<!--
    SENTINEL, second half. MSBuild walks up for Directory.Build.targets SEPARATELY from
    Directory.Build.props, so the props sentinel beside this file does not stop it. Without this the
    repository root Directory.Build.targets would apply to this project.

    Today the root targets are all conditioned on MSBuildProjectName == 'Main' and would be inert here,
    so this file changes nothing at the moment. It is present so that the isolation Decision D3 asks for
    is a property of the directory rather than a property of somebody else's Condition attribute.
-->
<Project>
</Project>
